title: Authorizations › New Case › The stepper and the four steps
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId
intro: The strip at the top of New Case: Intake, Eligibility & Benefits, Clinical documentation, Review & submit. Authorization preparation (the agents' run) is the last section of Clinical documentation. Every step opens at any time, forward or back; the draft keeps what was typed and what the agents did. Each step shows one state under its name; hovering it gives the one reason.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "A case is open on any step"
screen sc1 "Header card: 'New Case', the case id once it has one\n'Authorization type' dropdown on the right\nStepper under it: four steps, each a button with its name and one state label"
process p1 "The current step: dark circle with its number\nComplete: a tick. Needs attention: a warning triangle. Blocked: a cross\nNot applicable: a dashed circle with a dash. Pending: the step number"
screen sWf "The workflow line under the stepper\nName, version, payer, info tip, 'View workflow', 'At Clinical documentation'"
click c1 "Click any step, including a later one"
process p2 "The draft's position moves to that step\nNothing typed and nothing the agents did is lost"
screen sc2 "Page shows that step\nNo sentence under the title and no step header: the stepper says where you are"
process pTip "Hover a step: its one-line reason\n'Needs the payer, member ID and dates', '2 warnings', 'The draft is ready'"
process pNoStart "Opening Clinical documentation never starts the agents\nIts last section, 'Authorization preparation', has one button: 'Start the agents'"

group gFwd "Each step's own buttons, in the bar at the bottom"
  click b1 "Intake: 'Save as draft', 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits'"
  click b2 "Eligibility & Benefits: 'Back', 'Save as draft', 'Continue to Clinical documentation'"
  click b3 "Clinical documentation: 'Back', 'Save as draft'\n'Continue to Review & submit' once all ten agents are done"
  click b4 "Review & submit: 'Back', 'Save as draft'\nThe button that signs is in the Sign card on the right"
endgroup
process pBack "'Back' goes one step back\nFrom Review & submit it opens the agents' section of Clinical documentation\nThe bar stays in view while a long step scrolls"
toast pHint "The bar's only line is a payer workflow warning, when there is one\ne.g. 'Workflow: Submission window: 1 business day left'"

click cLink "Click the link 'Case Manager' above the title"
goto gCm "Continues in: Case Manager"
screen sFull "Stepper on the full referral page\n'Intake' is current\nThe button 'Back to the case' sits beside the crumbs"
goto gFull "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › The full referral page"
goto gStates "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Step states"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Initial authorization"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Initial authorization"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Clinical documentation › The checklist and Continue"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Authorization preparation › Start the run and watch it"
goto g5 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Review & submit › The draft and the summary"
goto gWf "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Workflow › Show the workflow and its path"

s1 --> sc1 --> p1 --> c1
sc1 --> pTip
sc1 --> sWf -.-> gWf
c1 --> p2 --> sc2
sc2 -.-> pNoStart --> g4
sc2 --> b1 --> g1
sc2 --> b2 --> g2
sc2 --> b3 --> g3
sc2 --> b4 --> g5
b2 --> pBack
b3 --> pBack
b4 --> pBack
b1 -.-> pHint
b3 -.-> pHint
p1 -.-> gStates
sc1 --> cLink --> gCm
sc1 -.-> sFull --> gFull
